                    <occupation>Accountant</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>We have no basis for thinking that the Duncan, accountant, who calls on
                            Godwin in 1825, is covered by other entries. This looks like a
                            professional job, assaying Godwin's resources following the declaration
                            of Bankrupcy on 17-03-1825. The follow up calls in 1826 to Basinghall
                            Street and Duncan, concern the sale of Godwin's property which was undertaken at offices there.</p>
